{
  "tema": 5246,
  "slug": "quise-quisiste",
  "titulo": "Querer in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Quise llamarte, pero no tenía señal.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Querer is irregular in the preterite: stem quis- + -e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron: quise, quisiste, quiso, quisimos, quisieron. It often means «tried to», and no quiso means «refused».",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Querer** (_to want_) changes its stem to **quis-** in the preterite, spelled with **s**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The endings are **-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron**, with **no written accents**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "querer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "quise"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "quisiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "quiso"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "quisimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "quisieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Because the preterite is one finished moment, **quise** + infinitive often means _I tried to_ (I wanted and acted)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No quiso** + infinitive means _he refused to_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **quise** = I wanted it and made a move; **no quiso** = he dug in his heels and said no."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Quise== llamarte, pero no tenía señal.",
              "en": "I tried to call you, but I had no signal."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hijo no ==quiso== comer las verduras.",
              "en": "My son refused to eat his vegetables."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Quisimos== entrar al concierto, pero ya estaba lleno.",
              "en": "We tried to get into the concert, but it was already full."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Por qué no ==quisiste== venir con nosotros?",
              "en": "Why didn't you want to come with us?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Los vecinos no ==quisieron== pagar la reparación de la barda.",
              "en": "The neighbors refused to pay for fixing the fence."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi entrenador ==quiso== enseñarme una llave nueva, pero me lastimé el hombro.",
              "en": "My coach wanted to teach me a new submission, but I hurt my shoulder."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ella ==quiso== sembrar chiles, pero hacía demasiado frío.",
              "en": "She tried to plant chiles, but it was too cold."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
